    "Details": "The U configuration of the Umbriel is designed for combat in environments where lasers or autocannons are less reliable. It is the only configuration that drops the Astral Hammer, and instead mounts 6 Enhanced LRM-15 launchers, spread over the arms and side torsos. A single ER Medium Laser in the head provides some limited capabilities of self defense.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Wrath of Blake</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.26</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
